[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=AI-CAD
Comment=AI-native parametric CAD
Exec=AI-CAD2 %F
Icon=AI-CAD
Categories=Graphics;Engineering;
Terminal=false
X-BinaryName=AI-CAD2
X-SourceTree=ui/imgui
# NOTE: binary is built as ui/imgui/build/bin/AI-CAD2 (preset: linux-app,
# output: build/linux-app/bin/AI-CAD2). In the AppImage this is staged to
# usr/bin/AI-CAD2 and launched via AppRun. For system installs, install
# build/linux-app/bin/AI-CAD2 to a PATH directory.
# BRANDING NOTE for Hunter: window title is "ShopCraft" (T-G3) but binary/desktop
# name is AI-CAD2/AI-CAD. Renaming binary or product name is Hunter's call — not
# changed here per T-G24 policy.
